<title>UK: BOE revises liquidity surplus to flat position.</title>
<headline>BOE revises liquidity surplus to flat position.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England did not offer the UK money market an afternoon round of assistance after revising the liquidity shortage forecast to flat from a previous forecast of a 250 million stg surplus.</p>
</text>
